  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Kanban Component**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on creating the Kanban board component. The current thinking centers on a horizontally scrolling container to neatly house all twelve phases. Each phase column will feature a header, complete with the phase\'s name and its associated icon or color.\n\n\n**Adding Kanban Enhancements**\n\nI\'ve been iterating on the Kanban card design. I\'m incorporating features like the card count badge, total phase value, and SLA indicators within each phase. We\'re also looking to provide quick actions and drag-and-drop or click-to-move functionality. Within each card, I\'m integrating elements similar to Pipefy, but also adding priority pills, specific highlights depending on the current phase, SLA countdowns, and checklist progress indicators. I\'m also planning quick action buttons for easy interaction, and a quick filter bar for filtering by consultant and priority, with total pipeline stats. The next step is `src/components/KanbanBoard.tsx`.\n\n\n"
