    thinking: "**Constructing Card Detail Modal**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on building the Card Detail Modal, specifically `src/components/CardModal.tsx`. The main structure is coming together with a Header, including editable fields for the Card Title, Company Name, and Value (R$). I\'m also incorporating a Priority Selector and the Phase Progress Stepper Bar which will allow for clickable navigation.\n\n\n**Adding Inner Tabs**\n\nI\'ve progressed to integrating inner tabs within the card detail modal. I\'m prioritizing the development of the \'Perguntas & Campos do Processo\' tab, which includes dynamic form inputs tailored to each phase, such as Mapeado, Diagn\303\263stica, and Proposta. Answer saving with an audit log is also a top concern. Following that, I\'m integrating WhatsApp integration to simulate live chat interaction, offering pre-configured templates and a \'wa.me\' link.\n\n\n"
