  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Lead Requirements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the structure for `leadsService.ts`. I\'m breaking down the requirement to create `leads` and `lead_interactions` tables, including the specific data points needed for each. I\'m focusing on \"dados cadastrais,\" \"consultor respons\303\241vel,\" and interactions/annotations to flesh out the schema.\n\n\n**Designing Data Structures**\n\nI\'ve crafted a SQL generator function, `getSupabaseSchemaSQL()`, to ensure precise PostgreSQL DDL. It creates `leads` with fields for cadastral data, status, assigned consultants, and custom fields. The `lead_interactions` table will support indexed AI messages by date, and I\'m ensuring efficient retrieval with pagination for high lead volumes.\n\n\n**Defining Table Attributes**\n\nI\'ve specified additional temporal attributes for the `leads` table including `due_date`, `last_contact_at`, `entered_current_phase_at`, and `created_at` and `updated_at` timestamps. The `lead_interactions` table has also been flushed out with the relevant attributes needed. I\'m focusing on defining indexes to ensure high-performance lookups and pagination.\n\n\n**Implementing Security Measures**\n\nI\'ve just added a full-text search index to the `leads` table using GIN for the relevant fields. I\'ve also enabled Row Level Security on both `leads` and `lead_interactions` tables. I\'m setting public read/write policies for anonymous access to facilitate basic operations. Furthermore, I\'m defining crucial data conversion helpers to translate database rows into CRMCard, LeadInteraction, and CardMessage structures.\n\n\n**Defining Data Retrieval**\n\nI\'ve scoped out the functions for fetching lead data. `getPaginatedLeads` is now defined, complete with filtering by phase, assigned user, priority, and search terms, alongside pagination. I\'m also ready with `getLeadInteractions` which will fetch lead-specific interaction history. I\'ve also scoped out functions to create, update, and move leads within the database, and I\'m ensuring efficient data retrieval.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 12
      nanos: 993600114
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
