    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFstZFJ4eO7BcOSNGDz0Y0dwGrqibSoAcVclsqmUTpZCd0aVByGgU6xUlmVZI2Ut2ycucTPgj43JcxGZqBXwv1IhNKZQs_E0k5XupUi4O8Wq1C2fjlRO7rMt5OAFb9cK0AwCofJ0J2G1xN-hSLHjC6soQ=="
      title: "prismic.io"
    }
    web_documents {
      url: "https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGqXOF8SD5JvKRwQD7wBEnjJt9ZMmuNcrNnnh421eP7vX6KxVu3QKaCbo4Rxq7UYEyl6U7fm-3CvotGoOrnj3O_Eg1-AnyZB-kSQchq-4a-i5oau8RAz3ubUhA7SE1IgmUM86-buNc="
      title: "youtube.com"
    }
    summary: "In Tailwind CSS v4, the `dark:` class variant allows you to style elements specifically for dark mode. The approach to dark mode has shifted in v4, with a move towards CSS-first configuration.\n\nBy default, in Tailwind CSS v4, the `dark:` variant will automatically apply styles based on the user\'s system preference (i.e., the `prefers-color-scheme` CSS media feature). This means if a user has dark mode enabled at the operating system level, the `dark:` utility classes will be active without any additional configuration. For example, to set a dark background and light text in dark mode, you would use `bg-white text-gray-900 dark:bg-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100`[1][2].\n\nFor scenarios where you want to allow users to manually toggle dark mode via a class (e.g., by adding a `.dark` class to the `html` or `body` element), the configuration process has changed from v3. In v4, the `tailwind.config.js` file, previously used to set `darkMode: \'class\'`, is often no longer present as configuration has moved directly into CSS[1].\n\nTo enable class-based dark mode in Tailwind CSS v4, you\'ll need to define a custom variant in your main CSS file. This is typically done using an `@custom-variant` directive, such as:\n`@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *));`[3][1][4]\nor\n`@custom-variant dark (&:is(.dark *));`[5]\n\nThis CSS rule tells Tailwind to apply the `dark:` styles whenever an ancestor element (including the element itself) has the `.dark` class[5][6]. You would then use JavaScript to add or remove this `.dark` class from your `<html>` or `<body>` element to switch between themes, often persisting the user\'s preference in `localStorage`[7][8][9]. Many implementations also recommend a \"three-state\" toggle, allowing users to choose between light, dark, or system-following themes[1][2].\n\nSources:\n[1] [tryhoverify.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHafbAedeBjxxCm1-yE1xCGcNZklBFgFbSW27-ObODUC7uZapY_PMegSOQuNhdgK5rbT6GG-1VuZ_wZQE9etCypkDOEtgjdBnAhes0hD-FVKlBVrhpuaerXQvmMM_xnhjCW7B3ikSGqUGEIHogM0L_5DiAv0efh30CztR8_AX5g5ogfv0V59BBDIPPE6YTk)\n[2] [flaviocopes.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEbu5-B0MHn3lSxMqudNxM7Yqzyj-fnE_2ongjzwACLISLKYx-z5l4-nyKTv2ee3tStpHfU-03w5ptD1dwABxGUFzBGeZB8eNwt2O-0V7y_CHHSOOnJDQ7qXErfHY0UaEX_CRcUa41tLw6nCUYKgR_uqx7z60mH)\n[3] [flowbite.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQETOF6ZFALcQa-lN2c7hrsvyQ785w9zDrcIlfkcxLnmA27khQuwxVOAL5BDdnejAFnzj9XEOKlFrtDIL8ykTlht9CQG76Zlsyl1F0RTKat1bZVR3yFnS8O9bFwbf2g-3x1GAcZH5NsnavY=)\n[4] [staticmania.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHYXVcb7fgUr4FYr5rf5EQXIsM0z-n3ZB0J3u7auVYEDWn1x4pOYQO056-btWBx4ReWWjzvknNAcuKYMx6FR3tl57L-9AmOgAL3BuSPmqqIXkFN-hHKstWnYWMw6BcEbHwXTOMuwLo0Xk2M6dnU)\n[5] [dev.to](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEm5krvmKpBnu0OlB5mcCfg2tTC28wIZwB-hrp--ocqvNiVy3FbNGTNOV0dYtOs7Z6ottUk6KCD3HZj5GlmXO3xujDTSvGnKUyfW1yCn6ICseih6VdZLauYK6b__tndM55px0P_we-aBQC3IjvjCUR-WR5n)\n[6] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFxGjKn0QjeklzkTtmSYS1Q5D9wIJr4ilRsoJFWMqFVPaHz8n9FhKiXK87K4Yx7HW8uNkt1e-DWY0njZvHq3d3mnB8jwgYezj4sxO_x9DE9L1Ocf-SGyJvw_ZzzlnjQT-l0K3h65GI=)\n[7] [tailwindcss.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGEAnjw2g0TbCfXe9adv-d-72RAqNIDS_DvakTE56Iqfc5Q20fR0gSiKAJye8MqA1-Rfj2he-bV3-CDyzHO9FO80U5TRV0k8CBg78X9q3cqWGYkn80LXKXkL2RXDswBBqsF)\n[8] [prismic.io](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFstZFJ4eO7BcOSNGDz0Y0dwGrqibSoAcVclsqmUTpZCd0aVByGgU6xUlmVZI2Ut2ycucTPgj43JcxGZqBXwv1IhNKZQs_E0k5XupUi4O8Wq1C2fjlRO7rMt5OAFb9cK0AwCofJ0J2G1xN-hSLHjC6soQ==)\n[9] [youtube.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGqXOF8SD5JvKRwQD7wBEnjJt9ZMmuNcrNnnh421eP7vX6KxVu3QKaCbo4Rxq7UYEyl6U7fm-3CvotGoOrnj3O_Eg1-AnyZB-kSQchq-4a-i5oau8RAz3ubUhA7SE1IgmUM86-buNc=)"
